{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/7648874e71697c0f807e706a1bfdae1f.poster.avif?t=1759949121\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/7648874e71697c0f807e706a1bfdae1f.webm?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/7648874e71697c0f807e706a1bfdae1f.mp4?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &quot;Isekai HKV&quot; is a 2D top-down pixel-style Roguelike game themed around Vtubers crossing into another world, inspired by &quot;Dead Cells,&quot; &quot;Vampire Survivors,&quot; and &quot;Holocure.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will take on the role of the hero &quot;DD,&quot; entering a forest filled with spatial distortions,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fighting alongside companions against endless waves of enemies and defeating the demon lord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/7f7fec53eeb3c9d74bb05493bd6f91a3.poster.avif?t=1759949121\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/7f7fec53eeb3c9d74bb05493bd6f91a3.webm?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/7f7fec53eeb3c9d74bb05493bd6f91a3.mp4?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Vtubers have been affected by mysterious forces, transforming them all into brainwashed powerful demon lord lieutenants (Bosses).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the hero &quot;DD,&quot; players need to challenge these Bosses one by one and rescue them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a Boss's brainwashing is lifted, they not only become the player's companion to fight alongside them, but players can also use their powers to battle the demon lord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, this twisted forest continuously attracts connection points from various different worlds, causing constant interdimensional invasion events in this forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it is precisely because of this that the hero &quot;DD&quot; can bypass the demon lord army's multiple defensive networks at the fastest speed and directly challenge their lieutenants (Vtubers)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/a491aaa1f485c6853f47742e2fb3e70b.poster.avif?t=1759949121\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/a491aaa1f485c6853f47742e2fb3e70b.webm?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/a491aaa1f485c6853f47742e2fb3e70b.mp4?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player character attacks automatically, while players are responsible for movement and dodging attacks (Space) and optimizing damage output.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies grants experience points, and upon leveling up, players can choose to enhance weapons, skills, or companion abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each companion has unique attacks and skills that influence tactical choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The companion system is core - players can defeat Bosses (Vtubers) to recruit them as AI teammates to enter levels together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each level, players enhance their own or their companions' power through leveling up to handle later enemy swarms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interdimensional invasion events provide various different terrain effects and modes, such as occupying specific areas within a time limit to activate magic towers, triggering terrain relics to summon monsters or Bosses from other worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interdimensional invasions will spawn at random locations at specific times during levels, adding unpredictability and testing real-time decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to continuously explore the map to discover these areas, and successfully completing invasion events will grant additional rewards or abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/577378d224c4b822e27af6a6c6b5da68.poster.avif?t=1759949121\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/577378d224c4b822e27af6a6c6b5da68.webm?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/577378d224c4b822e27af6a6c6b5da68.mp4?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/e008a0d533f44bc80ec2b5a1f9be71f4.poster.avif?t=1759949121\" width=314 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/e008a0d533f44bc80ec2b5a1f9be71f4.webm?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/e008a0d533f44bc80ec2b5a1f9be71f4.mp4?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In VTuber culture, DD is a very common term that comes from the Japanese phrase &quot;\u8ab0\u3067\u3082\u5927\u597d\u304d&quot; (Daredemo Daisuki), which means &quot;love everyone.&quot; Simply put, DD is used to describe fans who like many different VTubers, rather than focusing their support on just one VTuber.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948940?t=1759949121","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/b00c08847d27b7d80eddd3c6372bae6e41a5f58f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759949121","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/45d3d0192da414314722a692471a2c487fb6763e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759949121","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/45d3d0192da414314722a692471a2c487fb6763e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759949121","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/7648874e71697c0f807e706a1bfdae1f.poster.avif?t=1759949121\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/7648874e71697c0f807e706a1bfdae1f.webm?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/7648874e71697c0f807e706a1bfdae1f.mp4?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &quot;Isekai HKV&quot; is a 2D top-down pixel-style Roguelike game themed around Vtubers crossing into another world, inspired by &quot;Dead Cells,&quot; &quot;Vampire Survivors,&quot; and &quot;Holocure.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will take on the role of the hero &quot;DD,&quot; entering a forest filled with spatial distortions,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fighting alongside companions against endless waves of enemies and defeating the demon lord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/7f7fec53eeb3c9d74bb05493bd6f91a3.poster.avif?t=1759949121\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/7f7fec53eeb3c9d74bb05493bd6f91a3.webm?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/7f7fec53eeb3c9d74bb05493bd6f91a3.mp4?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Vtubers have been affected by mysterious forces, transforming them all into brainwashed powerful demon lord lieutenants (Bosses).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the hero &quot;DD,&quot; players need to challenge these Bosses one by one and rescue them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a Boss's brainwashing is lifted, they not only become the player's companion to fight alongside them, but players can also use their powers to battle the demon lord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, this twisted forest continuously attracts connection points from various different worlds, causing constant interdimensional invasion events in this forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it is precisely because of this that the hero &quot;DD&quot; can bypass the demon lord army's multiple defensive networks at the fastest speed and directly challenge their lieutenants (Vtubers)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/a491aaa1f485c6853f47742e2fb3e70b.poster.avif?t=1759949121\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/a491aaa1f485c6853f47742e2fb3e70b.webm?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/a491aaa1f485c6853f47742e2fb3e70b.mp4?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player character attacks automatically, while players are responsible for movement and dodging attacks (Space) and optimizing damage output.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies grants experience points, and upon leveling up, players can choose to enhance weapons, skills, or companion abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each companion has unique attacks and skills that influence tactical choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The companion system is core - players can defeat Bosses (Vtubers) to recruit them as AI teammates to enter levels together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each level, players enhance their own or their companions' power through leveling up to handle later enemy swarms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interdimensional invasion events provide various different terrain effects and modes, such as occupying specific areas within a time limit to activate magic towers, triggering terrain relics to summon monsters or Bosses from other worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interdimensional invasions will spawn at random locations at specific times during levels, adding unpredictability and testing real-time decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to continuously explore the map to discover these areas, and successfully completing invasion events will grant additional rewards or abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/577378d224c4b822e27af6a6c6b5da68.poster.avif?t=1759949121\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/577378d224c4b822e27af6a6c6b5da68.webm?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/577378d224c4b822e27af6a6c6b5da68.mp4?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/e008a0d533f44bc80ec2b5a1f9be71f4.poster.avif?t=1759949121\" width=314 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/e008a0d533f44bc80ec2b5a1f9be71f4.webm?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948940/extras/e008a0d533f44bc80ec2b5a1f9be71f4.mp4?t=1759949121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In VTuber culture, DD is a very common term that comes from the Japanese phrase &quot;\u8ab0\u3067\u3082\u5927\u597d\u304d&quot; (Daredemo Daisuki), which means &quot;love everyone.&quot; 